  "rationale": "The production selection and sealed tools compared a persisted economic report with their expected config, but the reusable claim builder and sealed-access validators accepted any canonically hashed Round 27 economic report. A direct caller could therefore lower trade gates, relax book freshness, change latency observation, reduce the expected-edge floor, or enlarge notional and still mint a selection economic claim. This correction derives every selection economic setting from the supplied frozen contract and requires exact report equality at claim creation and every sealed-access path. Unit-level simulator controls remain available for mechanics tests, while no noncontract config can cross the irreversible artifact boundary. No target, outcome, feature, candidate, metric, threshold, prompt, or authority was accessed or changed.",
